{"notice":"Tanzil Quran Text, Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project, License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0. Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies of this text, but changing it is not allowed. This Quran text can be used in any website or application, provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep track of changes. Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/ Word meanings and transliteration: Layout and word data from the Quranic Universal Library (https://qul.tarteel.ai), by Tarteel.","ayat":[[["وَٱلشَّمْسِ","By the sun","wal-shamsi","وَالشَّمْسِ"],["وَضُحَىٰهَا","and its brightness","waḍuḥāhā","وَضُحٰىهَا"]],[["وَٱلْقَمَرِ","And the moon","wal-qamari","وَالْقَمَرِ"],["إِذَا","when","idhā","اِذَا"],["تَلَىٰهَا","it follows it","talāhā","تَلٰىهَا"]],[["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","And the day","wal-nahāri","وَالنَّهَارِ"],["إِذَا","when","idhā","اِذَا"],["جَلَّىٰهَا","it displays it","jallāhā","جَلّٰىهَا"]],[["وَٱلَّيْلِ","And the night","wa-al-layli","وَالَّیْلِ"],["إِذَا","when","idhā","اِذَا"],["يَغْشَىٰهَا","it covers it","yaghshāhā","یَغْشٰىهَا"]],[["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","And the heaven","wal-samāi","وَالسَّمَآءِ"],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā","وَمَا"],["بَنَىٰهَا","constructed it","banāhā","بَنٰىهَا"]],[["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","And the earth","wal-arḍi","وَالْاَرْضِ"],["وَمَا","and by (He) Who","wamā","وَمَا"],["طَحَىٰهَا","spread it","ṭaḥāhā","طَحٰىهَا"]],[["وَنَفْسٍ","And (the) soul","wanafsin","وَنَفْسٍ"],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā","وَّمَا"],["سَوَّىٰهَا","proportioned it","sawwāhā","سَوّٰىهَا"]],[["فَأَلْهَمَهَا","And He inspired it","fa-alhamahā","فَاَلْهَمَهَا"],["فُجُورَهَا","(to distinguish) its wickedness","fujūrahā","فُجُوْرَهَا"],["وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","and its righteousness","wataqwāhā","وَتَقْوٰىهَا"]],[["قَدْ","Indeed","qad","قَدْ"],["أَفْلَحَ","he succeeds","aflaḥa","اَفْلَحَ"],["مَن","who","man","مَنْ"],["زَكَّىٰهَا","purifies it","zakkāhā","زَكّٰىهَا"]],[["وَقَدْ","And indeed","waqad","وَقَدْ"],["خَابَ","he fails","khāba","خَابَ"],["مَن","who","man","مَنْ"],["دَسَّىٰهَا","buries it","dassāhā","دَسّٰىهَا"]],[["كَذَّبَتْ","Denied","kadhabat","كَذَّبَتْ"],["ثَمُودُ","Thamud","thamūdu","ثَمُوْدُ"],["بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","by their transgression","biṭaghwāhā","بِطَغْوٰىهَاۤ"]],[["إِذِ","When","idhi","اِذِ"],["ٱنۢبَعَثَ","(was) sent forth","inbaʿatha","انْۢبَعَثَ"],["أَشْقَىٰهَا","(the) most wicked of them","ashqāhā","اَشْقٰىهَا"]],[["فَقَالَ","But said","faqāla","فَقَالَ"],["لَهُمْ","to them","lahum","لَهُمْ"],["رَسُولُ","(the) Messenger","rasūlu","رَسُوْلُ"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","اللّٰهِ"],["نَاقَةَ","(It is the) she-camel","nāqata","نَاقَةَ"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","اللّٰهِ"],["وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","and her drink","wasuq'yāhā","وَسُقْیٰهَا"]],[["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","But they denied him","fakadhabūhu","فَكَذَّبُوْهُ"],["فَعَقَرُوهَا","and they hamstrung her","faʿaqarūhā","فَعَقَرُوْهَا"],["فَدَمْدَمَ","So destroyed","fadamdama","فَدَمْدَمَ"],["عَلَيْهِمْ","them","ʿalayhim","عَلَیْهِمْ"],["رَبُّهُم","their Lord","rabbuhum","رَبُّهُمْ"],["بِذَنۢبِهِمْ","for their sin","bidhanbihim","بِذَنْۢبِهِمْ"],["فَسَوَّىٰهَا","and leveled them","fasawwāhā","فَسَوّٰىهَا"]],[["وَلَا","And not","walā","وَلَا"],["يَخَافُ","He fears","yakhāfu","یَخَافُ"],["عُقْبَـٰهَا","its consequences","ʿuq'bāhā","عُقْبٰهَا"]]]}